    "body": "Its forecast takes this form: direction and probability, over 20 sessions (return leg); 10 sessions (exhaustion leg). It is graded on a score that rewards probabilities that land close to what actually happens. It would be ended if after 200 episodes, either leg's confidence interval includes its null. It counts as proven at 200 episodes.",
